CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1785273510
OL,3,CNumber of police investigating
OL,4,Cfinancial crime cut in Jersey
OL,6,FOnly eight of 84 cases investigated by
OL,7,FJersey's Financial Crime Bureau led to
OL,8,Fprosecutions last year.
OL,10,FThey can be incredibly complex, with
OL,11,Fone involving suspected terrorism
OL,12,Ffunding, and a number are still being
OL,13,Flooked into.
OL,15,FHowever, concerns have been raised
OL,16,Fabout the level of staffing needed to
OL,17,Feffectively run so many investigations.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/11
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1785273510
OL,3,CNumber of police investigating
OL,4,Cfinancial crime cut in Jersey
OL,6,FData revealed by an ITV Channel
OL,7,FFreedom of Information request shows
OL,8,Fthat the number of officers working in
OL,9,Fthe States of Jersey Police Financial
OL,10,FCrime Bureau has fallen by nearly a
OL,11,Fquarter since 2022.
OL,13,FThere were a total of 13 officers
OL,14,Ftasked with investigating such
OL,15,Foffences four years ago, compared to
OL,16,F10 now.
OL,18,FThe current roster includes six full-
OL,19,Ftime police staff, three civilians and
OL,20,Fa Detective Inspector who splits their
OL,21,Ftime with another department.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/11
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1785273510
OL,3,CNumber of police investigating
OL,4,Cfinancial crime cut in Jersey
OL,6,FITV Channel spoke to shop owner
OL,7,FDeirdre Bates, who was scammed out of
OL,8,Fmore than #90,000 in 2023, and says
OL,9,Fshe understands how difficult it is
OL,10,Ffor police to prosecute financial
OL,11,Fcriminals.
OL,13,FDeirdre has since recovered all of the
OL,14,Fmoney she lost, but it took 16 months
OL,15,Fand left her "devastated".
OL,17,FHer money was stolen and spent in
OL,18,Fdifferent countries, and as she
OL,19,Fexplains, it is extremely challenging
OL,20,Fto identify the culprits.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/11
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1785273510
OL,3,CNumber of police investigating
OL,4,Cfinancial crime cut in Jersey
OL,6,FDeirdre states: "These fraudsters are
OL,7,Fbased all over the world so I don't
OL,8,Fknow how you would target these people.
OL,10,F"If it can happen to me, it can happen
OL,11,Fto anyone.
OL,13,F"They're so clever, these fraudsters.
OL,14,FThey're so clever."
OL,16,FRather than pointing a finger at the
OL,17,Fisland's police force, Deirdre says
OL,18,Fshe wants to see banks be more active
OL,19,Fand empathetic in how they deal with
OL,20,Fvictims of offences such as fraud.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/11
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1785273510
OL,3,CNumber of police investigating
OL,4,Cfinancial crime cut in Jersey
OL,6,FShe explains: "The police are too
OL,7,Fbusy. They've for too much on their
OL,8,Fplate. They can't do anything.
OL,10,F"I, personally, would've wanted more
OL,11,Fhelp from the bank."
OL,13,FAn independent report made in July
OL,14,F2024 by MONEYVAL, a monitoring body
OL,15,Fwithin the human rights organisation
OL,16,FCouncil of Europe, found that Jersey
OL,17,Frequired no "fundamental improvements"
OL,18,Fin the way it deals with offences,
OL,19,Falthough this mainly referred to how
OL,20,Finstances of money laundering and the
OL,21,Ffinancing of terrorism are tackled.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/11
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1785273510
OL,3,CNumber of police investigating
OL,4,Cfinancial crime cut in Jersey
OL,6,FFinance lawyer Barry Faudemer told ITV
OL,7,FNews that recovering money from fraud
OL,8,Fscams can be extremely complex and
OL,9,Frequires substantial resources to
OL,10,Finvestigate - something that many
OL,11,Fpolice forces just do not have.
OL,13,FHe adds: "If it's complicated and the
OL,14,Foffender is overseas and it's a
OL,15,Fsophisticated organised crime group
OL,16,Fconducting the fraud operation, the
OL,17,Fchances of detection and bringing
OL,18,Fthose people to book are, from what I
OL,19,Fsee, quite remote.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/11
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1785273510
OL,3,CNumber of police investigating
OL,4,Cfinancial crime cut in Jersey
OL,6,F"If I suffer a fraud and I'm the only
OL,7,Fone, I'm highly unlikely to get any
OL,8,Fmeaningful response from anybody, but
OL,9,Fif I'm part of a group of 500, the
OL,10,Fchances are it'll be allocated to a
OL,11,Fpolice force in some shape or form.
OL,13,F"But a lot of these police forces just
OL,14,Fdon't have the resources for it. They
OL,15,Freally don't have the resources for
OL,16,Fthat."
OL,18,FMr Faudemer would like the police to
OL,19,Fwork more closely with banks and
OL,20,Fregulators to bring criminals to
OL,21,Fjustice.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G7/11
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1785273510
OL,3,CNumber of police investigating
OL,4,Cfinancial crime cut in Jersey
OL,6,FHe asks: "Is law enforcement fully
OL,7,Fequipped? Can the banks do more, can
OL,8,Fthe regulators do more, can the public
OL,9,Fdo more to try and combat fraud?
OL,11,F"It's about getting everyone to work
OL,12,Ftogether, and no one agency carries
OL,13,Fresponsibility."
OL,15,FHe also believes the crime figures
OL,16,Freleased by the States of Jersey
OL,17,FPolice should be taken with a pinch of
OL,18,Fsalt as many people may not report
OL,19,Fthat they have been scammed.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G8/11
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1785273510
OL,3,CNumber of police investigating
OL,4,Cfinancial crime cut in Jersey
OL,6,FMr Faudemer explains: "The statistics
OL,7,Fthat you're getting from the police
OL,8,Fare literally the tip of the iceberg
OL,9,Fbecause people are embarrassed. They
OL,10,Fdon't want to stand up in a court and
OL,11,Fadmit that they were duped."
OL,13,FWhat should I do if I think I have
OL,14,Fbeen scammed?
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G9/11
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,357,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1785273510
OL,3,CNumber of police investigating
OL,4,Cfinancial crime cut in Jersey
OL,6,FIf you may have shared any financial
OL,7,Fdetails or given someone access to
OL,8,Fyour online banking, you should
OL,9,Fimmediately contact your bank by
OL,10,Fcalling the number on the back of your
OL,11,Fcard so they can take steps to secure
OL,12,Fyour accounts.
OL,14,FYou can also call the police on 01534
OL,15,F612612 in Jersey and 01481 222222 in
OL,16,FGuernsey, or 999 if you feel
OL,17,Fthreatened.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws        G10/11
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
